| `publish_time_bucket` | `publish_hour_slt` | Sri Lanka local time, four buckets: early morning (00:00–05:59), morning/afternoon (06:00–14:59), evening (15:00–20:59), late night (21:00–23:59). Exact cut points confirmed against the observed hour histogram before finalising |
| `category_encoded` | `category_name` | Target encoding — see 4.4 |
